<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:820px">
    <div class="text-center" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
      <span class="section-label">Timeline</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-inline:auto">The whole process, end to end.</h2>
    </div>

    <ol class="timeline">
      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-time">Day 1 &middot; About 20&ndash;30 minutes</span>
        <h3>Discovery call</h3>
        <p>We get on the phone, learn what you do, and figure out what the site needs to accomplish. No sales pitch. No pressure. If we're not the right fit, we'll tell you.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>What you do and who you serve</li>
          <li>What's working (or not) with your current site</li>
          <li>What the new site needs to do; phone calls, booked jobs, quote requests</li>
          <li>Timeline, content, and any questions you have</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-time">Day 1&ndash;2 &middot; Agreement &amp; kickoff</span>
        <h3>Service agreement &amp; first payment</h3>
        <p>You sign a simple one-page service agreement and make your first $175 payment. We start building that day. No large deposit, no waiting around.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Plain-language service agreement emailed to you</li>
          <li>First monthly payment processed securely</li>
          <li>Shared folder for your logo, photos, and any content</li>
          <li>We kick off the design the same day you sign</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-time">Week 1&ndash;2 &middot; 7&ndash;10 business days</span>
        <h3>Design &amp; build</h3>
        <p>Every line of code written from scratch for your brand. You get a live preview link within a few days and can request unlimited revisions. We don't charge by the change.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Design tailored to your industry and services</li>
          <li>Custom code. No WordPress, no page builders</li>
          <li>Live preview link to share with your team</li>
          <li>Unlimited revisions until you're happy</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-time">Week 2&ndash;3 &middot; Launch day</span>
        <h3>Launch</h3>
        <p>We point your domain at our hosting, verify everything is live, submit the sitemap to Google, and hand over a simple one-page owner's guide. You don't have to touch anything.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>DNS configured &amp; SSL activated</li>
          <li>Sitemap submitted to Google &amp; Bing</li>
          <li>Local-business schema verified against the site</li>
          <li>One-page owner's guide emailed to you</li>
        </ul>
      </li>

      <li class="timeline-item">
        <span class="timeline-time">Ongoing &middot; For as long as you're with us</span>
        <h3>Updates, support, &amp; maintenance</h3>
        <p>This is the easy part. Email us any change, any question, any problem; we usually handle it the same business day. Hosting, security, uptime, and updates are all included.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Unlimited content updates included</li>
          <li>24/7 emergency support; real person, not a ticket queue</li>
          <li>Security monitoring &amp; maintenance</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
